    feather-light copies that Ente Photos backs up. Ente Photos' sticker style:
    white, 2.6 dp #1C1C1C outline, #E8E8E8 inner crescent, Ente's green heart
    tucked top-left. Background layer: flat #08C225.
    Layers: one ink silhouette (outline, quill and heart outline as a single
    shape, so no seams), the white paper, the grey shading, the green heart.
-->
